<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">-NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT.</book>
  <para style="h">BaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo lwaPaulo Kuba Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaEfe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo lwaPaulo</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUBA EFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo kubaEfeso lwakakwalwa nonshaji unanga wakakwalwa nawo lukwalo lokubaKolose mugole makumi mashanu nemwepela mushule mokuzwalwa kwaKristo. Unkwali unozwiti umpositoli Paulu (baEfeso 1.1) Babhati boluzibo lwebhaibhili banji banovumilana kuti Paulu ndiye wakakwala baEfeso kojoba kusina inzila yokumusa kukwe sezwimo munabaKolose. Nokudalo lungaba lwakananga kukwendeswa mumakubungano alosiyanasiyana munayelo idunhu. Paulu unoleba akale kuti wakaba elimuntolongo paakakwala lukwalo yolu (baEfeso 3.1, 4.1, na 6.20). Paulu wakatumila lukwalo yolu naTayikikasi elipalwendo lokushanyila igubungano kuEfeso (baEfeso 6.21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso lyakaba liliguta igulwana kasa akale uli unzinda unkulwana wabaRoma mudunhu lyeEzhiya Maina. IEfeso yakabeli nempuwo nokuda kwetempeli lyakaba lyakapilwa kunamwalikaji wabaGiliki unowhi Atemisi (Mishingo 19.23-31). Igubungano lyokuEfeso lyakatanga nesimba asi likoba lisilosungwala (Zwakatondejelwa 2.1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu unopandulula muchikamu chotanga cholukwalo yolu kuti Mwali wakashaluja banhu babe, akale akabachija kuva kuzwibi zwabo nomunaJesu Kristo. Unokwejanisa igubungano nombili, naKristu sonsholo, akale sechibakwa, naKristo sechinde lyengumba. Muchikamu chabili cholukwalo, Paulu unopa indayijo yokulalama bupenyu bwechiKristo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unozwisuma akale emusa baEfeso (baEfeso 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Esikopandulula bukamu pakati pegubungano naKristo (baEfeso 1:3—3:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unondilambeli ekwala inzila ilokwelela kutobelejwa namaKristo (baEfeso 4:1—6:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kokupejisila Paulu unopa mawhi okusungwaja opejeleja (baEfeso 6:21-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Paulu uMpositoli waKristo Jesu nokuda kwaMwali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Kubachena balibo balobimbika munaKristo Jesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Chipiwo kwamuli nolunyalalo lunova kunaMwali Tate bedu nokuna Tezi Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwikombolelo zwoMpepo munaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Ngekombolelwe Mwali naTate baTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, wakati kombolela nezwikombolelo zwose zwompepo kubugalo bwokudenga munaKristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kojoba akatishala muna iye, inyika isanhu yabumbwa, kuti tibe bachena akale tisina zwibi mbeli kukwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Wakatigajika muludo, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />kuti tibe bana babe nomunaJesu Kristo pezhulu pobubuya bwakabeda, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />mulukujo lwechipiwo chiche chinongaima, chaakatipa zwisina indipo kubadiwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Tina lusupuko muna iye, pezhulu pelopa lilye, nokulekejelwa koluchinyo lwedu, nokuda kwokufuma kwechipiwo chiche, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />chaakatikashulila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Nobuchenjevu bubwe bose akale nokuwhisisa, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />wakatizibisa isiswa lyechido chiche, pezhulu pechinangwa chiche chibuya chaakalonga kupejeleja munaKristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Sobulongwa buzhele bonshaji ukumuzha, wokushanganisa zwinhu zwose zwokudenga nozwo pasi muna Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Muna iye, nokuda kwechinangwa chiche chantolo, iye unozhajikija zwinhu zwose pezhulu pokulaya nechido chiche, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />isu takatanga kudimbwa munaKristo, tikashalwa akale tikaponchwa kulalamila kutunhumwija lukujo lulwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Muna iye mwakawha mawhi echokomende, iNdebo iMbuya yoluchijo lwenu, akale mwakadimbwa mwaali, mwakanamwa noMpepo uNchena umwakabimbiswa. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Chili chibimbiso cheshabo lyedu kuswikila tawana ifuma lolusupuko lyokutunhumwija lukujo lulwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unamato waPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Nechisoko yechi, nokuti ndakawha nokudimbwa kwenu munaTezi Jesu, noludo lwenu kubachena bose, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />anditoleka kupa kuboka nozwenu, ndimukumbulukwa muminamato yangu, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />kuti Mwali waTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, Tate bolukujo, bemupe umpepo wobuchenjevu akale nechitondejelo choluzibo lulwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Kuti mesho emyoyo yenu ezhulike, akale muzibe lubimbo lwaakamushobela, nokuti ini ifuma yolukujo, lweshabo iye kubachena, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />akale ini bukulugulu businokwelaniswa bwesimba lilye munasu banodimbwa, nenzila yokushinga kobukulwana bubwe <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ndilo lyaakashingisa paakamusa Kristo mubafi, akoonta kuti iye egale kululyi lulwe lwobugalo bwokudenga, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />pezhulu pobutongi nobukulwana, nesimba nobushe, nopezhulu pamazina ose alobandwa kusi koono unshaji woga pe asi nounozha, <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />akale Mwali wakabiga zwinhu zwose pasi pamakumbo aKristo, kova onta untungamili wezwinhu zwose, etila igubungano <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />ilyo lili umbili uwe, kuzhala kukwe iye unozhaja zwose muna zwose.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuva muKufa kunda kuBupenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Imwi wakamumusa kuva mukufa mwezwikanganiso zwenu noluchinyo, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />lwamwakaba mwakwenda nalwo mutobela inzila yenyika yeyi, mutobela unchinda wesimba lyemipepo, iliyo ikumushinga ngweno mukati mwabana basinowhilila. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Pakati paba isu tose takabagala muludo lwemibili yedu, titobela zwilakamilo zwombili nendangalilo, nokudalo nolubumbo takatiwa bana bobukali sabanhu bose.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Koga Mwali, ulofuma neshe pezhulu poludo lulwe lukulwana lwaakatida nalwo, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />kojoba patakabechakafa muluchinyo lwedu, takatiwa bapenyu pamwempela naKristo nokuti nechipiwo mwakachijwa, <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />akale Mwali wakatimusa naKristo, akale akata kuti tigale naye mubugalo bokudenga munaKristo Jesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />kuti munshaji unozha etondejele ifuma isinobandika yechipiwo chiche mushe, kunasu muna Kristo Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Nokudalo nechipiwo chiche mwaka chijwa pezhulu pokudimbwa, yezwi azwitova kunamwi, koga chipo chaMwali, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />zwisi pezhulu pemishingo, kuti kusibe nonhu uchashiya. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nokuti tinshingo uwe, takabumbilwa munaKristo Jesu kuti tite mishingo mibuya yakalonganywa naMwali ntolo kuti tiite.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bumwempela munaKristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ngweno kumbulukwani kuti noumwe unshaji mwakaba mulibokuzhe nokuzwalwa, mwaluwhi basakamhalajwa naabo banozwiti bakamhalajwa, zwinotiwa mumbili namaboko, <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />kumbulukwani kuti nooyo unshaji mwakabakapambulwa kuna Kristo, mwakaba mwasiyiwa kuzhe kwabanhu beIzilayeli, akale bavakule kuzwivumilano zwechibimbiso, musina lubimbo akale musina Mwali munyika. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Koga feno, munaKristo Jesu imwi mwaluba muli kule ntolo, ngweno mwakasendejwa pelyo nelopa lyaKristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Pakuti iye emene lunyalalo lwedu, nokuti wakatita bamwempela, akale akakolomola bulambo bolubengo, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />iye wakajima mumbili uwe mulawo nezwilayijo, kuti ezwibumbe unhu umwepela mubanhu babili muna iye, kuti ete lunyalalo, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />akale mumbili umwempela, wakata kuti induji imbili jikamujane kunaMwali nonchinjikwa wakapalaja lubengo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Akale wakezha akabhaunula lunyalalo kunamwi mwakabeli kule, akale lunyalalo kunaabo bakabeli pelyo, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />nokuti muna iye, isu tose tinoswika kunaTate noMpepo umwempela.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nokudalo imwi amuchibavakule kana bakwendi pe, koga mwaba boluji lwabachena, muli bengumba yaMwali, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />mwakabakwa pezhulu pamatangisilo abapositoli naba polofeti, Kristo Jesu emene eli iye ibhango chikabukabu chengumba, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />chibakwa chose chinoshangana pamwepela, chiba itempeli ijena lyaTezi, <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />imwibo mulobakilwa panhu pamwempela nabamwe muna iye kuti mube ingumba yaMwali muMpepo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mishingo yaPaulu kunaBokuzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Pezhulu pechisoko yechi, imi Paulu, unsungwa waKristo Jesu ndakamilila imwi Bokuzhe, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />ndinobimba kuti mose mwakawha nezwo nshingo wechipiwo chaMwali wandakapilwa imwi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />sezwandakatondejelwa kuti isiswa ndilizibe, sezwandakakwala mubufupi. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Pamuchabala yezwi mobonesesa luzibo lwangu musiswa lyaKristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />lisakabazibiswa kubanhu, bezwimwe zwizekululu zwantolo, lyatondejelwa ngweno kubapositoli babe bachena nokubapolofeti noMpepo, <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />yeyi ndiyo inzila Bokuzhe ibanobanayo balyifumikwaina, nokuti baba umbili umwempela, bano kobana chibimbiso munaKristo Jesu mundebo imbuya.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Imi ndomene ndakashalwa kuba unshingi wendebo imbuya nokuda kwechipo chechipiwo chaMwali chandakapiwa pezhulu pokushinga kwamasimba awe. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kojoba ndili untukutuku pakati pabachena bose, yechi chipiwo ndakapiwa kuti ndibhaunula kunaBokuzhe, bufumi bukulugulu bwaKristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />kuti banhu bose bezibe bulongwa bulosisika, bwakasiswa kwamakole munaMwali umbumbi wezwinhu zwose, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />kutila kuti, nomugubungano bachinda nabatongi bokumatenga bezibiswe kusiyana kobuchenjevu bwose bwaMwali. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Yezwi zwakendila mundangalilo iye yechinangwa chisinopela yakazhajikijwa munaKristo Jesu Tezi wedu, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />muna Kristo atina kutya akale tobimba naye, kungwina kunaMwali, pezhulu pokudimbwa kwedu muna iye. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Nokudalo ndinokumbila kuti musilashe mwoyo nokusheteswa kwandinotiwa pezhulu penu, nokuti masheto angu lukujo lwenu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludo lwaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Pezhulu pechisoko yechi ndinofhigama mbeli kwaTate, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />kuva kunaiye imhuli yose kudenga nopenyika inopiwa izina, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />kuti, zwindila mubufumi bolukujo lulwe ungati angasimisa unhu womukati mwenu nesimba lyompepo uwe, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />akale kuti Kristo egale mumyoyo yenu nokudimbwa, kuti mujike miji akale mubakwe muludo, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Nezwo kuti imwi, pamwepela nabachena bose, kuti mube nesimba lyokuwhisisisa bwasha, bulefu, nokulebha, nontika, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />kuti muzibe ludo lwaKristo lunopinda luzibo lwose, kuti muzhajwe nobupumbulu bose bwaMwali.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Ngweno kuna iye unesimba lyokuta zwinhu zwikulwana kasa zwinopinda zwose zwatinokumbila nezwatinoyeya namasimba awe, anoshinga mwatili, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />kuna iye ngakube lukujo mugubungano nomunaKristo Jesu muzwizekululu zwose, kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Bumwempela bwombili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Nokudalo imi unsungwa, waTezi, ndinokumbila kuti mulalame bupenyu bunokwelela kushobwa kwenu, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />nokuzwideluja kose, nobunyolo nomwoyo ndefu, mutambulana umwe nomwe noludo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mudisisa kulondota bumwempela bwoMpepo muchisungo cholunyalalo. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuna uMbili umwempela noMpepo umwempela, sezwa mwakashobwa kuchibimbo chimwempela, chimo mukushobwa kwenu, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Tezi umwempela, luvumilo lumwempela, umbhabhatizo umwempela, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />kuna Mwali umwempela akale eli Tate bedu tose, iye upezhulu pabose, nomuna bose akale muna bose.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Koga umwe noumwe wakapiwa chipiwo chinokwelaniswa nechipo munzila yanopa nayo Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Nokudalo kwakawhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Paakatanha pezhulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Wakatungamilila batapwa banji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Akapa zwipo kubanhu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Pakuti “wakatanha zhezhulu” zwinoleba ni? Zwinoleba kuti wakaba abhulukila kubugalo bunomila bwenyika. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Iye wakabhuluka, ndiye wakatanha akale pezhulu kumatenga ose, kuti ezhajise zwinhu zwose. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Wakapa zwipo zwizwe kuti bamwe bebe bapositoli, bamwe bebe bapolofeti, bamwe bebe babhaunuli beNdebo iMbuya, bamwe bebebalyisi begubungano, nabamwe bo bebe balayiji, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />kupa bachena zwishingiso kuti bezwibambile kutamishingo yokubaka uMbili waKristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />kuswikila tose tashangana mubumwempela bwokudimbwa nobwo luzibo lwoMwananhululmyana waMwali, tibumba uNhu ulo pelelela unokwelaniswa nechimilo chizhele chaKristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />kutila kuti tisishobwe kuwhi tibacheche akale, tikungulijwa mbeli nomushule nokunyamulwa nemipepo yose inolayija maniepwa, tichengejwa nabanhu nobusoso bwabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Koga tilebeleke ilebeswa muludo, kuti tikubuke munzila jose tikwenda munaKristo, uli iye unsholo wedu, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />zwivamuna iye, umbili wose unoshanganiswa pamwempela, nemhingu jose jishinga zwibuyanana jinokubusa umbili akale jizwibaka muludo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupenyu Bupya munaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Nokudalo ndinomusimisa, ndinomusimikijila munaTezi nditi ilekejani kulalama saBokuzhe banotobela zwisina unshingo mundangalilo jabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Bane ndangalilo jiloswibha kasa, bakapambukana nobupenyu bwaMwali nokuti apana chibanowhisisa, pezhulu pobukukutu bwemyoyo yabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Sezwabasichina ishoni, babanolunya akale bezwipila mububi bose, belakamila kuta zwose zweshambwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Azwitoba izwo zwimwakalayijwa nezwaKristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ngatiti imwi mwakawha nezwizwe, pamwakalayijwa nezwizwe, nokuti ichokomende limo munaJesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Lashani ungalilo wenu wantolo, mumbule unhu wantolo, walusomuta kuti mugale mubupenyu busakalulama pezhulu pobuchengeji bwozwilakamilo. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Myoyo yenu nendangalilo jenu ngazwitiwe bupya zwilopelelela. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Akale ibani nobunhu bupya bunotojana naMwali muzwitondejela mubululami nomubuchena bwechokomende.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nokudalo siyani maniepwa, umwenomwe ngelebe ilebeswa kumbakijani uwe, nokuti tose timhingu jombili umwempela chete. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nyemani asi musichinye, akale izhuba lisimile mukanyema, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />akale musipe Guluzhanje chibaka. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Imbava ngileke bubava, koga ngiishinge zwilobimbika namaboko ayo, kutila kuti itubule kubhancha yabo banoshayiwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Mumilomo yenu musi bhude malebo mabi, koga ebe mawhi mabuya onobaka sezwinokwelela kuta panoyo unshaji, kutila kuti chibe chikombolelo kunabo bawhile. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Musinyeteje uMpepo uNchena waMwali nokuti ndiwo wakamubigila imhande yawo kujine kuswike izhuba lyokumunulwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Kwose kulwajilwa komyoyo, nolunya, nokunyema, nokupopota, nokupita, nezwibi zwose ngazwibhiswe kwamuli, <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />itilanani ishe, myoyo minyolo, nokulekejelana, sezwa mwakalekejelwa naMwali munaKristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kugala muMwenje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Nokudalo kwejejelani Mwali sabana banodikana, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />akale kwendani muludo, sezwo Kristo wakatida akatifila sompilo nombhayilo unonhuwilila kunaMwali.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Koga pakati penu akutokwelela kuba nobusangu kana kupi kusoshambijika kana kutangala, nokuti yezwi azwijilokwelela kubanhu bachena baMwali. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kusibe nezwisheshemiso, kana kulebeleka zwobulema, kana isawu ihukutu, jisilokwelela koga ngakube kuboka Mwali. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ibani nechokomende kuti apana usangu kana unhu usiloshambijika, kana unotangala ndiko kuti unokuja zwibezhwa, angaba undyifuma mubushe bwaKristo nobwaMwali.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kusibe nouchamuchengela namawhi asinobaka nokuti munayezwi zwinhu bukali bwaMwali bunozha pezhulu pabasinowhilila. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nokudalo musilyijane nabo, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />mwaluba inhilima umwe nshaji, koga ngweno mwaba mwenje munaShe, kwendani sabana bomwenje, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />nokuti michelo yomwenje inowanikwa muna zwose zwibuya, zwilolulama akale zwechokomende. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Kwejani kulayijwa zwinoshantisa Tezi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Musiwanikwe mumishingo yenhilima isina michelo, koga zwifumuleni zwibe pachena. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Nokuti zwinopisa ishoni kulebeleka zwinhu zwabanota musiswa, <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />koga chili chose chafumulwa nomwenje chinoboneka, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />nokudalo chili chose chinoboneka mwenje, sezwo kunowhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Muka iwi ulele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">akale imuka mubafi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">akale Kristo unopenya paulu.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Lingisisani kasakasa ukwendelo wenu kuti ulichini, kusi samalema koga sabalochenjela. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Shingisani zwibuya nshaji unji nokuti timomumazhuba mabi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nokudalo musibe malema, koga whisisani kuti chido chaTezi ini.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Akale musikolwe newaini, nokuti ndimo munova kulundula, koga izhajwani noMpepo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Lebelekisanani nekumo nejimbo akale nejimbo jompepo, mukwimba nokushanta kunaTezi mumyoyo yenu, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />kuna zwose pani kuboka nshaji wose kunaMwali Tate muzina lyaTezi wedu Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balume nabaKaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ibani pasi poumwe noumwe solulemeso kuna Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Bakaji zwidelejeni pasi pabalume benu, sokuna naTezi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Nokuti undume ndiye unsholo wonkaji sezwo Kristo eli unsholo wegubungano, umbili uwe, akale eli uNchiji wawo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Sezwo igubungano lili pasi paKristo, nezwo bakaji bo ngababe pasi pabalume babo muna zwose.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Balume, idani bakaji benu sezwo Kristo akada igubungano akazwipila nokuda kwalo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Kuti elichenese iye, elishapuluja nokulishambisa nevula akale newhi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />kuti angapila igubungano kwaali emene mukungaima, pasina ibala kana kukokonyala kana zwimwe zwinhu zwakadalo kuti libe ijena lisina ibata. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Kojoba zwakadalo balume ngabede bakaji babo, sokuda kwabanota mibili yabo. Iye unoda unkaji uwe unozwidabo. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />(Nokuti akuna unhu wakababenga umbili uwe, koga unoundondota nokuubhata zwibuyanana saKristo sezwaanota igubungano, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />nokuti timhingu jombili uwe). <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Nechisoko yechi unhulume unosiya tate namai babe, etuko shanganiswa nonkaji uwe, akale babili yaba bachaba umbili umwempela.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Yeli isiswa igulwana akale ndileba zwaKristo negubungano. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nokudalo, umwe nomwe wenu ngede unkaji uwe somwaanozwida, akale unkaji ngebone kuti unolemekeja undume uwe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Bana nabaZwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Bana whililani bazwali benu munaTezi nokuti yezwi zwilokwelela. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Lemesa tate namai babo” yoyu ndiwo undayo wotanga unachibimbiso, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“kuti zwikululamile iwi akale kuti ulalame bupenyu bulefu penyika.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />MaTate musinyemise bana benu kuti benyetele koga bakubuseni mubalaye nomundayo jaTezi.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balanda nabaTezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Balanda lemekejani matezi enu openyika, nolutyo nokudedema, nomwoyo uloshambijika somunaKristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Kusili kuti moshinga mukalingwa, sabanoshantisa banhu koga sabalanda baKristo beta kuda kwaMwali zwiva mumwoyo, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />muta unshingo wenu nolushanto nomwoyo wenu wose, soti mumushingila Tezi kusi banhu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Muzibe kuti zwibuya zwose zwamunota unowana zwilokwelela kuva kuna Tezi, kojoba muli balanda kana balosupuka.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Namwi Matezi itani zwakadalo mbeli kwabalanda benu muleke kubahatamija sezwo muziba kuti Iye uli Tezi wabo eli Tezi wenu bo uko kudenga akale aane shalulo.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwilwaniso zwose zwaMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kopejeleja, simani munaTezi akale nomumasimba obukulwana bubwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mbalani zwose zwilaniso zwaMwali kuti mukwanise kumilana nobusoso bwaguluzhanje. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Nokuti atijikumulwana nombili nelopa, koga timulwana nobutongi namasimba, nabatungamilili benyika benhilima yeyino nemipepo mibi kubugalo bokumatenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nokudalo tolani zwilwaniso zwose zwaMwali kuti mutubule kumisikijana nezhuba lyobubi akale mwata zwose kuti mume mwakasima.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Nezwo imani mwakazwibambanyila mwakazwisunga ibhanti lyechokomende mushana, mwakambala chitabilijo chechifuba chobululami. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Mwambala ishangu jenu, mubambanyila indebo imbuya yolunyalalo, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />pezhulu pezwi zwose tolani intibi yokudimbwa yokujimisa misebe inovilima yombi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Mutole inhulu yoluchijo, akale negwalabaza lyoMpepo lili iwhi lyaMwali. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Namatani unshaji wose muMpepo, neminamato yose akale nezwikumbilo. Nezwo chenjelani nokunangatila kose mutila zwikumbilo bachena bose, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />akale nami mundinamatile kuti ndipiwe kulebeleka nefuba ndibhaunula isiswa lyendebo imbuya, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />nokuti ndili umililili ulosungwa namaketani. Ndinamatileni kuti ndizwilebelekele ndisina lutyo sezwa ndilokwelela kulebeleka.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumusa kopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Ngweno kuti mungaziba namwi kuti ndili chini akale kuti ndikumutani, Tichikasi mwanakwaina wangu unodikana akale unshingili ulobimbika munaTezi unomubuja zwose. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ndotuma kwamuli nechinangwa yechi kuti muzibe kuti tilichini akale kuti esungwaje myoyo yenu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Banakwaina lunyalalo ngalube kwamuli, noludo nokudimbwa zwinova kunaMwali Tate nokuna Tezi Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Chipiwo ngachibe namwi mose, banoda Tezi Jesu Kristo noludo lusinopela.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>